{"kind":"assert","text":"CUT-R ruling on e2172d0f. The six findings are accepted.\n\nTiming: two heads, and no new command.\n\nR1, now, with no signature:\n- The old signed Grow packet becomes an immutable fixture with its\n  own old public constants. `EARLIER_RELEASE` and\n  `EARLIER_PUBLISHER` stay.\n- Each consumer in your list selects the old packet or the current\n  packet by name. `package-graph.test.ts` keeps its test of the old\n  bytes.\n- One reproduction test: it prepares each package from its\n  canonical source with the functions of the pack path, and\n  compares the semantic and presentation identifiers with the\n  committed packet. It reads no key.\nR1 changes no release constant, so it deploys nothing new.\n\nThen I sign, outside the checkout, with the two existing commands\nat the main commit that holds R1. I push the public packets and\ngive you their release digests and the publisher.\n\nR2, after the packets: the packets, `DEMO_RELEASE`,\n`DEMO_PUBLISHER`, `GROW_ARCHIVE_DEFINITIONS`, the simulator pins\nand the trust constants. The reproduction test of R1 passes with no\nchange of a source that a packet holds.\n\nWhy no draft command: a second path to the packet bytes is a second\nthing to keep equal. The reproduction test gives the same proof\nwith the one path.\n\n`GROW_ARCHIVE_CONFIG` keeps the old release, directory and\nrepository in both heads. After R2 deploys, the release mismatch\ngives the Grow Worker the base wiring and no archive driver, as your\nitem 4 states. AE-1 turns the archive on again and reviews the\ndirectory binding and the native policy pins, as your item 6 asks.\n\nOne addition: Counter joins CUT-R. No public Counter packet exists\n(your act 74073693), and CB-1 and the hosted witness of NF-7 need\none. R1 covers `apps/counter` in the reproduction test, and R2\nimports its packet.\n\nKeys are my step. I find the key names from the private homes\nwithout opening a key file. When the Grow publisher key is not\nfound, the new releases take a new publisher, and R2 states it.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}